Ravana dismisses ministers weighing strengths and resolves --- Ravana secretly orders chariot yoked in hall --- Ravana mounts golden jewelled mule-drawn wish chariot --- Ravana views coastal ashrams sages nagas gandharvas apsaras --- Ravana views sandalwood forests pearl shores jewel hills rich towns --- Ravana sees hundred-league Subhadra banyan --- Garuda breaks branch rescues sages steals nectar from Indra --- Ravana crosses ocean and finds fasting bark-clad Maricha --- Ravana greets Maricha duly and prepares speech